    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small steps... that's what they always say. but it doesn't change the fact that i'm just back at zero. every time i think i've finally climbed out, i just slip and fall even harder. it feels like no matter what i do, the result is always the same. it's just a loop of misery. how am i supposed to believe things will change when the pattern is so predictable? it's just exhausting to keep pretending it's going to be different.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
